{"strongs": "H5818", "word": "עֻזִּיָּהוּ", "translit": "uz.ziy.yah", "root": "עור", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "my strength is", "definition": "עֻזִּיָּהוּ , עֻזִּיָּה proper name, masculine ( my strength is ׳ י ; compare Old Hebrew עזיו Lzb 338 ); — 1. Οζειας , but also Αζαριας : king of Judah = ׃עְַזַרְיָהוּ \\ \\ a. עֻזִּיָּהוּ 2Kgs 15:32 ; 2Kgs 15:34 ; 2Chr 26:1 ; 2Chr 26:3 ; 2Chr 26:8 ; 2Chr 26:9 ; 2Chr 26:11 ; 2Chr 26:14 ; 2Chr 26:18 (twice in verse); 2Chr 26:19 ; 2Chr 26:21 ; 2Chr 26:22 ; 2Chr 26:23 ; 2Chr 27:2 ; Isa 1:1 ; Isa 6:1 ; Isa 7:1 . \\ \\ b. עֻזִּיָּה 2Kgs 15:13 ; 2Kgs 15:30 ; Hos 1:1 ; Amos 1:1 ; Zech 14:5 . 2. עֻזִּיָּהוּ father of an officer of David 1Chr 27:25 . 3. עֻזִּיָּה Levite name 1Chr 6:9 . 4. id.: priest with foreign wife Ezra 10:21 . 5. id.: name in Judah Neh 11:4 (also v Neh 11:5 ᵐ5 for חזיה ). — See also יַעֲזִיָּהוּ .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5955')\">BDB5955</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5818')\">H5818</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5954')\">BDB5954</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5956')\">BDB5956</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>עֻזִּיָּהוּ</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>עֻזִּיָּה</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> (<highlight>my strength is</highlight> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>; compare Old Hebrew <bdbheb>עזיו</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ldzb')\">Lzb<sup>338</sup></lookup>); — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <grk>Οζειας</grk>, but also <grk>Αζαριας</grk>: king of Judah = <bdbheb>׃עְַזַרְיָהוּ</bdbheb> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <bdbheb>עֻזִּיָּהוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 15:32\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(12,15,32)\">2Kgs 15:32</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 15:34\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(12,15,34)\">2Kgs 15:34</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 26:1\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(14,